        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Whenever the need exists to fill a vacancy at any location, any employee who has satisfactorily performed work which is similar in nature to the work to be performed in the classification declared vacant at the station involved may move laterally into the section in which the opening is available, prior to the filling of the vacancy at the station as provided by Article XI. 3). Selection will be made on a departmental seniority basis from the employees who have given the Company prior written notice of their desire to do so. No more than one (1) move will be allowed from any one section to another as a result of the original vacancy or vacancies.",
